<title>HONG KONG: Pearl Oriental places 100 mln warrants.</title>
<headline>Pearl Oriental places 100 mln warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse Financial Products said it has issued 100 million American-style covered warrants on Pearl Oriental Holdings.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE  HK$4.50	    PREMIUM	 19 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE   HK$0.855	   GEARING	 5.26</p>
<p> EXPIRATION    06.NOV.97	  ISSUE DATE    06.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	 LUXEMBOURG	 MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  HK$4.50</p>
<p> NOTES	   CS FIRST BOSTON IS LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- Hong KOng Newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
</text>
